WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.507 --> 00:00:14.628
Roxy kept listening to the underground sounds.

2
00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:17.751
"I hear the ground shaking," she thought.

3
00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:21.933
"And something that sounds like a big machine underground.

4
00:00:22.854 --> 00:00:24.455
Plus those voices again.

5
00:00:25.476 --> 00:00:26.837
Where are they coming from?"

6
00:00:28.198 --> 00:00:30.860
Roxy looked at Detective Smith and the construction workers.

7
00:00:31.636 --> 00:00:33.858
"Everyone, stand back!"

8
00:00:34.098 --> 00:00:34.538
she said.

9
00:00:36.981 --> 00:00:38.822
Roxy started to spin like a top.

10
00:00:39.603 --> 00:00:41.264
A hole formed under her feet.

11
00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:43.766
Pieces of blacktop flew everywhere.

12
00:00:45.388 --> 00:00:49.111
She went faster and faster, drilling into the ground at super speed.

13
00:00:50.332 --> 00:00:51.173
"Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:51.353 --> 00:00:52.273
called Detective Smith.

15
00:00:52.293 --> 00:00:54.395
"What are you doing?"

16
00:00:55.676 --> 00:00:56.757
But Roxy didn't answer.

17
00:00:58.078 --> 00:00:59.660
She was already deep underground.

18
00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:05.920
Roxy arrived in a huge dark cave.

19
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.241
"Look! A human!"

20
00:01:07.481 --> 00:01:09.082
shouted a voice over the loud rumble.

21
00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:15.347
Using her super vision to see in the dark, Roxy spotted several tiny men.

22
00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:20.130
They had mole-like faces and wore brown jumpsuits.

23
00:01:21.671 --> 00:01:23.433
The men stood next to a big machine.

24
00:01:24.393 --> 00:01:27.576
It looked like it was built out of truck parts and other construction equipment.

25
00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:30.432
"Who are you?"

26
00:01:30.732 --> 00:01:31.473
Roxy demanded.

27
00:01:33.233 --> 00:01:36.114
One of the men pulled a lever, and the machine stopped running.

28
00:01:38.654 --> 00:01:39.915
"We're the mole men!"

29
00:01:40.115 --> 00:01:40.555
he said.

30
00:01:40.575 --> 00:01:44.176
"And we're going to destroy Metro City!"

31
00:01:45.276 --> 00:01:46.016
Roxy gulped.

32
00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:48.337
"Why do you want to do that?"

33
00:01:49.918 --> 00:01:51.538
The mole man glared at Roxy.

34
00:01:52.238 --> 00:01:55.559
"We're sick of humans digging sewers and subways down here.

35
00:01:56.559 --> 00:01:58.820
The underground is for mole men only!"

36
00:01:59.956 --> 00:02:01.217
He looked at the other mole men.

37
00:02:01.237 --> 00:02:02.177
"Grab her!"

38
00:02:05.039 --> 00:02:08.081
Two mole men ran toward Roxy, swinging iron pipes at her.

39
00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:10.062
Roxy jumped out of the way.

40
00:02:11.323 --> 00:02:13.204
The mole men crashed into the cave wall.

41
00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:15.585
"Ouch!" one cried.

42
00:02:17.006 --> 00:02:19.207
Whap! The other one swung his pipe.

43
00:02:19.227 --> 00:02:22.629
"Ouch!" the first one cried again.

44
00:02:22.649 --> 00:02:24.710
"Oops!" said the other.

45
00:02:25.851 --> 00:02:27.232
The two mole men looked around.

46
00:02:28.172 --> 00:02:29.473
"Where did she go?"

47
00:02:29.653 --> 00:02:30.133
they asked.

48
00:02:30.153 --> 00:02:35.757
"These mole men don't see very well," Roxy thought.

49
00:02:35.777 --> 00:02:37.998
"Just like real moles!"

50
00:02:38.019 --> 00:02:40.480
"There she is!"

51
00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.381
One mole man pointed at Roxy.

52
00:02:42.401 --> 00:02:45.243
"Get her!"

53
00:02:45.283 --> 00:02:46.904
More mole men ran toward Roxy.

54
00:02:46.944 --> 00:02:51.027
"No humans underground!"

55
00:02:51.247 --> 00:02:52.188
shouted one mole man.

56
00:02:54.028 --> 00:02:57.030
"The underground is for mole men only!"

57
00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.351
shouted a second mole man.

58
00:02:59.532 --> 00:03:01.173
Again Roxy jumped out of the way.

59
00:03:02.074 --> 00:03:03.815
All the mole men bumped into one another.

60
00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:07.178
They tripped and crashed into the wall.

61
00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:11.721
One mole man was still near the earthquake machine.

62
00:03:13.682 --> 00:03:17.966
He pulled the lever, and the machine rumbled loudly.

63
00:03:18.646 --> 00:03:20.908
Zap! A ray shot from the machine.

64
00:03:21.961 --> 00:03:25.841
It blasted the ceiling of the cave, and big rocks crashed down onto Roxy!
